  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy for Women Entrepreneurs (AWE) - - Supporting Mothers Through Natural Skincare</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to expand its processing activity of shea and other natural products into top skincare products / brands. Through the project, the enterprise will reach at least 1200 customers/ beneficiaries, including mothers seeking natural and good quality products for their babies, and other clients with sensitive, delicate skins&apos; needs.</narrative>
